vice/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4111570,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1846651706691556","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"🦆 The Gates Are Open, Steam Next Fest Is Here!","summary":"Steam Next Fest has officially begun, and Gate Guard Simulator is taking part!Our demo went live just a few days ago, and we're happy to see the first players sharing their experiences. The first Steam reviews are already in, with over 91% positive so far!If you haven't tried the demo yet, now's a great time to step into the role of a medieval gate guard. And if you've already played, we'd love to hear what you think!Enjoyed the Demo? Leave Us a Review! ❤️If you've had fun with Gate Guard Simula","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691556","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1846651706678688","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"📜 Hear Ye, Hear Ye! The Gate Guard Simulator Demo Is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hear ye, hear ye! Gather round, good people of Ramberg!Let it be known throughout the kingdom that the Gate Guard Simulator Demo is officially available to everyone on Steam!The gates are open, the rulebook is ready, and our town is in desperate need of capable guards. Anyone willing to take up this noble responsibility may now report for duty, free of charge and without prior experience.The position does, however, require a keen eye, a reasonable understanding of the King's Rules, and the abili","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:09:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678688","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1846018067944450","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"Gate Guard Simulator Playtest Is Over! Time for Your Feedback! 🏰","summary":"The gates are closed once again! Our latest Gate Guard Simulator Closed Playtest has officially come to an end. A big thank you to everyone who joined us this weekend and spent some time guarding the gates of Ramberg!We hope you enjoyed your shifts, met some interesting visitors, and managed to keep at least a few troublemakers out of town.Now it's time for the next important part: your feedback!📝 Tell Us How It Went!We're already starting to review the results of this playtest, so the sooner yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1846018067931010","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"🏰 The Gate Guard Simulator Closed Playtest Is LIVE!","summary":"Guards, it's time to report for duty! 🛡️Our latest closed playtest has officially begun, and selected participants can now jump in and explore a brand-new build of Gate Guard Simulator!The playtest will run through the end of Sunday, so you've got the whole weekend to inspect visitors, enforce the rules, and see what's changed at the gates.🔑 Check Your Inbox!We've already sent out emails containing Steam keys to selected applicants!Important: Everyone needs a new key this time, including returni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:19:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931010","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1845383656396179","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"Gate Guard Simulator is coming to Barcelona! 🏰","summary":"Pack your documents and make sure all your seals are in order, because Gate Guard Simulator is heading to SAGA Barcelona Game Fest!From October 9–11, you’ll find us at booth G01-9, where you’ll be able to play Gate Guard Simulator and meet the Forklift Interactive team in person.And Gate Guard won’t be travelling alone! We’re bringing a whole lineup of Forklift games to Barcelona:Prospice: Anomalous Logistics — an off-road exploration game about navigating treacherous terrain, managing supplies ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T11:59:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396179","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1845383656386938","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Applications Are Open!","summary":"The gates are opening again soon, and we’re looking for more guards ready to report for duty!A new closed Gate Guard Simulator playtest is planned to start around October 8 and run through the end of the weekend. We’re inviting a limited number of players to join us, play the latest version of the game, and help us shape it with their feedback.Want to take part?Fill out 👉 this application form 👈 and tell us a little about yourself.We’ll select a limited number of participants from the applicatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T16:12:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386938","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1843481262701472","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"The Playtest Is Over 📝 We Want Your Feedback!","summary":"The gates are closed once again! Our latest Gate Guard Simulator Closed Playtest has officially come to an end.Thank you to everyone who reported for duty this weekend and spent some time deciding who gets into Ramberg, who needs a closer inspection, and who definitely has some explaining to do.Now it’s our turn to ask some questions.📝 Tell Us What You ThinkIf you participated in the playtest, we’d really appreciate it if you took a few minutes to fill out our feedback form:👉 SHARE YOUR FEEDBACK","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:51:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1843481262692932","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"Gate Guard Simulator Closed Playtest Is Live!","summary":"The gates are open again. The Gate Guard Simulator Closed Playtest is now live and will remain available through the weekend, until the end of Sunday.🔑 How to Get AccessIf you participated in one of our previous Gate Guard Simulator playtests, your access has already been restored. Just look for Gate Guard Simulator Playtest in your Steam Library.If you haven’t participated before and submitted the application form, check your email and spam folder. We’ve just sent out Steam keys to selected par","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T17:02:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1842846814453556","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"A NEW CLOSED PLAYTEST IS ON THE WAY!","summary":"We’re getting ready for another Gate Guard Simulator playtest!This time, the playtest will be closed and will run through the weekend.If you participated in one of our previous Gate Guard Simulator playtests, there’s no need to apply again. Your access will return when the playtest begins, so just look for Gate Guard Simulator Playtest in your Steam Library.If you haven’t played before, you can sign up through our application form:👉 APPLY FOR THE CLOSED PLAYTESTWe’ll send access details by email","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T16:46:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453556","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1840944183782298","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"👑 The Second Open Playtest Is Over. Thank You!","summary":"Thanks for Joining Our Second Open Playtest!Our second Gate Guard Simulator Open Playtest is over. We hope you managed to stop by the gates, put a few suspicious travelers through a very thorough inspection, and had a good time doing it.Thank you to everyone who played! We’ve received a lot of feedback over the past week, along with bug reports, suggestions, and plenty of thoughts about what works and what still needs some attention. We’ll be going through all of it with the team as we continue ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T15:07:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782298","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1840310314342614","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"👑 By Order of the Crown: The Open Playtest Is Now Live!","summary":"🏰 The gates of Ramberg are officially openGate Guard Simulator’s second Open Playtest is now live, and everyone is invited to serve the Crown, inspect suspicious travelers, search questionable cargo, and confiscate anything that looks dangerously orange. The playtest will remain open for approximately one week.🔔 What’s New?Since the previous playtest, we’ve worked through a large amount of player feedback and prepared a much-improved build featuring:A visual overhaul and general improvementsExpa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T17:01:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1835236783570834","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"🛡️A Dispatch from the Gate: Thank You for Playing the Open Playtest!","summary":"📜 Hear ye, Gate Guards!Last week, the gates of the stronghold were opened for our Open Playtest, and thousands of new recruits stepped forward to uphold the law, inspect suspicious documents, question questionable peasants, and decide who was worthy of entering the Lord’s domain.Since then, we have been absolutely flooded with reports from the front line. Your feedback here on Steam, in our Discord, and through the Google Form has been incredibly valuable. Every forged seal spotted, every confus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T15:38:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783570834","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1835236783558465","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.5.2: Crash Fix for Older GPUs","summary":"📢 Patch 0.5.2 is live!We've shipped a fix that may help players who were experiencing crashes on older GPUs.If you previously had to use -dx11 to get the game running, update to version 0.5.2 and see if you can launch the game normally now 👀While we can't guarantee this will solve every issue on older hardware, our tests have been promising so far. If you were affected by these crashes, we'd love to hear whether the update worked for you.Thanks for helping us test and improve the game! The Gate ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T18:52:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783558465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1834602721196339","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"update","title":"🛡️ Open Playtest Update: Thank You for Your Feedback!","summary":"First of all, thank you to everyone who has joined the Gate Guard Simulator Open Playtest so far.The response has been fantastic, and we've already received a lot of valuable feedback, bug reports, and suggestions from players. It's incredibly helpful for us and will play a big part in shaping the game before release 👍⭐ The Playtest Is Still RunningIf you haven't had a chance to jump in yet, there's still time. The Open Playtest will continue for a few more days, and we'd love to hear what you t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721196339","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1825727806707608","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"🎥 First Gameplay Trailer Revealed at IGN Fan Fest!","summary":"Hello everyone!Yesterday, Gate Guard Simulator appeared at IGN Fan Fest, where we revealed our latest gameplay trailer. If you missed the event, you can watch it right here 👇This new trailer gives a sneak peek at updated gameplay and a closer look at what it really means to stand watch as a medieval gate guard. Inspect travelers’ papers, spot suspicious behavior, uncover contraband (yes, including with the help of a trained duck), and deal with everything from smugglers and plague outbreaks to t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-26T13:51:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806707608","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1819386365102509","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"🎄 Ho Ho Hold It Right There!","summary":"Ho ho hold it right there, citizen! 🎄🛡️Before you enter the festive season, documents, please. As the year comes to an end, we wanted to step out from behind the castle gates and say a huge thank you to everyone who has been following Gate Guard Simulator, wishlisting it, talking about it, and generally supporting us from the shadows like true medieval conspirators.Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year to you all. May your papers always be valid, your seals authentic, and your coffins never suspi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-22T17:29:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365102509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1818752592120387","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"✨ Welcome to the Cursed Words Open Playtest!","summary":"The Cursed Words Open Playtest is underway, and you’re welcome to join in whenever you like. If you enjoy games where language bends, tiles mutate and every run becomes its own unpredictable experiment, this is the perfect moment to try it out and help shape the game as it grows. Whether you enjoy clever word builds, explosive synergies or discovering strange new ways to break the rules, the ongoing Playtest gives you a chance to explore all of that and share your thoughts with us. 👉 If you deci","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-10T11:17:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592120387","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4111570-1818118366185806","game_id":"steam-4111570","kind":"announcement","title":"🛡️ Welcome to Gate Guard Simulator!","summary":"🏰 Hi everyone and welcome to the newly launched Steam page for Gate Guard Simulator.Today we’re opening the gates for the very first time and we’re excited to start sharing more about the world we’re building. If you enjoy thoughtful job sims, sharp observation and encounters full of small surprises, this is a project we think you’ll enjoy following.In Gate Guard Simulator, you play as a castle warden deciding who may, or may not, enter a medieval stronghold. Visitors arrive with documents, belo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-09T16:06:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366185806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4111570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4111570":"2026-10-26T01:45:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_s